  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\" alt=\"Faithful 64x\">\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft 的首选 64x 材质包。</h1>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此获取基岩版材质包\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><p>Minecraft 纹理升级的合理下一步。与 Faithful 32x 一样，本材质包基于默认美术风格——以四倍分辨率精妙重制，并恰到好处地添加额外细节，为您带来完美的原版风格 Minecraft 体验。 <br><br>通过直接以 32x 版本为基础制作纹理，它实现了包间高度一致性，并持续提升品质。如果你喜欢精细材质包但仍想保持原版感觉，那么这个包就是为你准备的！</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方网站\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">更多信息：</h1><p>如果您有任何反馈、想报告错误或需要帮助，请加入上方的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 服务器、提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 问题</a>或在下方评论。如有商业或分发相关问题，请参阅我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可协议</a>。 <br><br>所有纹理和附加组件均由志愿者利用空闲时间贡献。任何人都可以通过上方链接的 Discord 服务器提交纹理，或制作<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a>以在我们的网站上正式列名。开始前请务必阅读我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹理制作指南</a>，其中精确概述了材质包的艺术风格。 <br><br>每个材质包均可在我们的<a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上找到，部分材质包还列于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a>。 <strong>从其他任何网站下载均非官方、不受支持且可能存在危险！</strong> 请记住安全上网。</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我们的其他项目：</h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\" alt=\"Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一套开源且由社区驱动的 Minecraft 材质包合集，旨在提供更高分辨率的默认 Minecraft 纹理版本，同时忠实于原作。</div>",
